flowchart LR
    DAXSystem["D365 / DAX System"]
    GatewayIn["ffc-pay-gateway<br/>Inbound Poller"]
    BlobDPSIn["dps container<br/>inbound folder"]
    DpsParse["ffc-pay-dps<br/>Parse Ack file<br/>(typed as DAX)"]
    DpsPublish["ffc-pay-dps<br/>Publish renamed .ack file<br/>(FFC prefix stripped)"]
    BlobDAXOut["dax container<br/>outbound folder"]
    GatewayOut["ffc-pay-gateway<br/>Outbound Transfer"]
    TraderOut["Trader File Share<br/>DPS ack file<br/>+ control file"]

    DAXSystem -->|.ack acknowledgement file| GatewayIn
    GatewayIn -->|upload ack file| BlobDPSIn
    BlobDPSIn -->|poll pending files| DpsParse
    DpsParse -->|transform| DpsPublish
    DpsPublish -->|write renamed .ack file| BlobDAXOut
    BlobDAXOut -->|read by| GatewayOut
    GatewayOut -->|deliver ack + control file| TraderOut
